title: "CTA for suspected acute aortic syndrome: R analysis code and legacy source"
type: software
version: "2026-11-14-review"
authors:
  - family-names: "Jean-Baptiste"
    given-names: "Omar"
repository-code: "https://github.com/omar-rads/cta-aortic-dissection-study"
abstract: "R source code, published aggregate evidence and selected aggregate outputs for a retrospective study of emergency department CTA for suspected acute aortic syndrome. Historical SAS scripts and an earlier R checkpoint are retained for provenance. Patient-level data and private report-classification inputs are excluded."
keywords:
  - acute aortic syndrome
  - computed tomography angiography
  - ADD-RS
  - D-dimer
  - retrospective cohort
  - cost-consequence analysis
